{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/935965-becoming-unfettered","id":935965,"title":"Becoming Unfettered","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-23T00:00:46-07:00","id":935965,"title":"Becoming Unfettered","content":"My character might undergo the retreat in our next session and I have a few questions.<br /> <br /> 1) What parts, if any, of the original template are kept? The book really only goes into how Unfettered are different from other ephemerals in terms of traits. It doesn't' mention how things like kinship are affected or if the horror keeps the family birthright. This is especially jarring with atavisms as loosing some of those can change the entire feel of the horror with no listed numina to make up for the difference.<br /> <br /> 2) The &quot;Nightmare Weaponry&quot; Numina seems redundant. My understanding of the epehmeral rules is that if an entity should logically be capable of lethal damage or having a weapon bonus then it just has it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3323-cmwatford","name":"cmwatford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3323_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-26T01:27:26-07:00","id":937512,"title":"","content":"The way I've explained it is the Beast proper is combination of the Horror for your spiritual presence and the human for the physical presence. The Horror is able to use the human as sort of adapter to enable it's abilities to manifest in the material world. After all atavisms aren't strictly powers the Beast has they're functions the Horror has that are just bled through into the material. Consequently one of the Unfettered is the Horror devoid of the physical connection.<br /> <br /> So from what I can tell the Nightmare Weaponry numina is meant to enable one of the Unfettered to replicate their more physical atavisms ie fire starter and/or blast can replicate a salamander with a flame breath, but you'll want Nightmare Weaponry to the old rending claws in a capacity where they can actually harm people. <br /> <br /> I would say they might keep the birthright , but stuff like kinships are probably going away due to the Unfettered not generally being intelligent enough to really think on the subject. Even then the nature of an Unfettered is probably going to mean it won't care enough about your character's old family to make much of a difference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}